  "releaseNotes": "- Added some IniStreamHandlers, for simpler loading of ini files into Dictionaries.\n\t\t\t- Breaking change: Behaviour when options are set to allow line continuations and allow value escapes differs when there is a trailing backslash at the end of the file. Previously this would issue an error as it was interpreted as an incomplete escape sequence. Now, it is interpreted as a trailing line continuation, and no error is raised.",
